2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO] V2.5.17 [3 CHOP-BLEED GUARDS — 2026-06-18]
2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO]   + CONTEXT: 06-16 (-20.4pt/7trades) and 06-17 (-44.0pt/4trades) were both
2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO]     compressed chop days (full range 141pt & 107pt; 06-17 had 9 mean-crosses in
2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO]     a 107pt box). The regime classifier stayed BULL all 76 bars both days and
2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO]     chop_block fired 0 times, so the breakout engines kept firing into noise.
2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO]     See ~/orion_backtest_lab/results/RESULTS.md (2026-06-18 post-mortem).
2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO]   + #1 MORNING CHOP GATE (CHOP_GATE_ENABLED): decided ONCE after ~10:30 IST from
2026-07-24 03:32:05,577 [INFO]     the first-hour (09:15-10:15) FUT bars. Stand aside (block ALL new entries for
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     the day) when early efficiency-ratio <= CHOP_ER_MAX (0.25) AND (first-hour
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     FUT-VWAP cross-count >= CHOP_VWAP_CROSSES_MIN (3) OR first-hour range <
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     CHOP_RANGE_PT_MAX (110pt)). Exits always allowed. Fails OPEN (not enough
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     bars yet -> no decision -> trade normally). morning_chop_verdict().
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]   + #2 VWAP BODY BAND (VWAP_BODY_CLIMAX_PCT): VWAP entry now takes only the
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     65-86% body band — existing >=65% min kept, NEW >=87% climax/exhaustion bars
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     skipped (climax bars fade). One added guard line in check_vwap_signal().
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]   + #3 MOMENTUM-FADE GATE (FADE_GATE_ENABLED): for a 3rd+ consecutive same-side
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     entry that follows >= FADE_MIN_PRIOR_WINS (2) consecutive same-side WINS,
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     inspect 3-min option premiums of BOTH the trend-side and opposite-side ATM
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     strikes over the last FADE_OPT_BARS (3) closed bars. Enter ONLY IF the
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     trend-side option is NOT decaying AND the opposite-side option IS decaying;
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     otherwise skip (momentum has faded / is rotating to the other side). Fails
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     OPEN on missing data. fade_gate_ok() + fetch_option_3m(). Complements the
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]     V2.5.16 spot-move momentum gate (both must pass).
2026-07-24 03:32:05,578 [INFO]   + All three guards are ADDITIVE; ladder/HARDSL/flip/SMA8/stale-guard UNCHANGED.
